      "content": "TRING RURAL            LOWER ICKNIELD WAY SP 9013                                         (South side)                                         Wilstone 10/133                                  North Barn at -                                       Wilstone Little Farm GV                                      II Barn. Mid C17. Timber frame on tarred brick sill, dark weatherboarded with steep half-hipped roof now covered in corrugated iron. A tall 5-bays  barn  facing  S with double doors  in middle bay and  small winnowing door on N opposite. High pitching doors on S to side bays. Step-jowled posts, unjowled mid-bay posts, staggered mid-height rails, slender curved braces to irregular tie-beams. Segmental curved collars and long thin queen-struts to clasped-purlin roof with one purlin in each slope. Thin curved tension braces above rail. Thin rafters for thatch. Long straight wind-braces in end bays. Long splayed scarf joints next posts in wallplates and purlins. Listing NGR: SP9072513616"
    }
  ],
